%N A233391 List of values of d in infinite family of points on Mordell curve x^3-y^2=d over quadratic field sqrt(13).
%C A233391 All terms are of the form 59319 * k where k is odd.
%H A233391 <a href="/index/Rec#order_03">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (1299,-1299,1).
%F A233391 a(n) = 59319*(2*t(n)-1) where t(n) satisfies the linear recurrence t(n) = 1299*t(n-1) - 1299*t(n-2) + t(n-3) with t(1)=13, t(2)=23377, t(3)=30349813.
%F A233391 G.f.: 59319*x*(47*x^2-14278*x-25)/((x-1)*(x^2-1298*x+1)).
%F A233391 a(n) = A233379(n)^3 - A233392(n)^2.
%t A233391 CoefficientList[Series[59319*(-25 - 14278*x + 47*x^2)/(-1 + 1299*x - 1299*x^2 + x^3), {x,0,13}],x] (* _Georg Fischer_, Aug 18 2026 *)
